{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridaadventuresandrentals/items/490967/", "pk": 490967, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridaadventuresandrentals/", "pk": 13096, "shortname": "floridaadventuresandrentals", "name": "Florida Adventures and Rentals", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Audubon Birding Tour", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 1, "unicode": "Audubon Birding Tour", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 12.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 12.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 29444, "description": "# Join us for an extraordinary birding adventure with the remarkable Brittany Piersma, Field Biologist from Audubon Western Everglades. \n\n## Duration\n2.5 Hours\n\n## About\nEmbark on a journey through the enchanting 10,000 Islands, a sanctuary for stunning bird species that call these islands home or use them as a pitstop on their migratory route. Best of all, all profit made from this tour goes directly to supporting Audubon Western Everglades' vital conservation efforts!\n\nExplore the hidden world of birdlife that thrives among the mangroves and along Florida's picturesque coastline. These islands are teeming with Critical Wildlife Areas where nesting shorebirds lovingly raise their chicks, and the mangrove islands provide Bird Rookeries.\n \nNot only will you feast your eyes on a dazzling array of birds, but you'll also glean precious insights into their behavior and conservation, thanks to the expertise of Brittany. This tour isn't\njust about birdwatching; it's a chance to connect with Audubon Western Everglades and become part of their stewardship mission.\n \nOnboard our vessel, you'll be equipped with essentials for your birding expedition: water to keep you refreshed, a birding field guide to deepen your knowledge, and binoculars to enhance your bird-spotting abilities. Feel free to bring along your own snacks, drinks, binoculars, and cameras to make this adventure truly your own.\n \nOur tours are carefully scheduled to align with the ever changing rhythms of nature, including bird migrations, tides, and weather conditions. Keep in mind that each tour is unique – not all\nbird species may make an appearance. For example, the majestic White Pelicans grace us with their presence during winter, and  wading birds may choose to stay hidden during high tide. Expect the unexpected on every excursion!\n\nPlease note that tours are subject to cancellation if weather conditions pose any risks to our cherished guests and crew's safety.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Goodland Boat Park", "booking_notes": "#Departure Location: Goodland Boat Park, 750 Palm Point Dr., Goodland, FL 34140\n\n**$10 parking fee for non-Collier County Residents as of January 1, 2022 per Collier County Parks and Recreation regulations. Must be paid at the pay station at the park. Guests with Collier County Beach Parking Stickers displayed properly on windshield has parking for free.**\n\n**A parking assistant will be available to you for parking. Keep an eye out for a crew member wearing a Florida Adventures and Rentals shirt by the pavilion next to the main building, they will assist you for parking and checking in for the tour.** \n\n**The officials at the park are strict on parking. You can only park in designated spots. RVs are not allowed to park in any Collier County park.**\n\n#Check in information\n ***PLEASE ARRIVE 30 MINUTES PRIOR to tour start time***  \n\n***TOUR DEPARTS ON TIME***\n\n ***MEETING POINT: Your captain/guide will meet you by the pavilion picnic tables, wearing a Florida Adventures and Rentals shirt. You will be checked in and given instruction for your tour. While waiting for the tour you can use the restrooms or get anything you may need for the tour at the ship store.*** \n\n**Onboard our vessel, you'll be equipped with essentials for your birding expedition: water to keep you refreshed, a birding field guide to deepen your knowledge, and binoculars to enhance your bird-spotting abilities. Feel free to bring along your own snacks, drinks, binoculars, and cameras to make this adventure truly your own. Please wear outdoor comfortable wear.**", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "2.5 Hours • Special Monthly Event", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridaadventuresandrentals/items/490967/images/1039686/", "pk": 1039686, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/je2kFcwDTr6jDD9nXcnv", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/je2kFcwDTr6jDD9nXcnv", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridaadventuresandrentals/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridaadventuresandrentals/items/490967/"}, "crop": {"x": 0, "y": 138, "width": 1280, "height": 673, "url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/4p3ddaRUQMKY1nXl9hXA"}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/4p3ddaRUQMKY1nXl9hXA", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/4p3ddaRUQMKY1nXl9hXA", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "